        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">An outcome domain in the physiological or clinical outcome area, covering outcomes associated with the musculoskeletal and connective tissue system or condition group, such as joint pain, stiffness or bone density.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">Physiological domains follow MedDRA System Organ Classes, as in the COMET taxonomy.</obo:IAO_0000116>
