        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">An outcome measurement instrument of the Health Utilities Index family developed at McMaster University, comprising the HUI2 and HUI3 classification systems.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The family also includes HUI1 (Torrance 1982), which OHEO does not yet model.</obo:IAO_0000116>
