        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A knee-specific patient-reported outcome measure of 12 items on pain and function, scored from 0 to 48.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">Reports a single total score, so it is not classed as a health profile instrument (0.2.0 fix pass).</obo:IAO_0000116>
