        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">An EQ-5D-5L value set elicited from a sample of the Spanish general population.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The worst health state utility was carried over from 0.1.0 and has not been checked against the paper, so the record rules only warn when a utility falls below it.</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">Valued with a hybrid model combining composite time trade-off and discrete choice data.</obo:IAO_0000116>
