        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A patient-reported outcome measure of 20 items measuring recovery-focused quality of life for people with mental health difficulties.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">Its developers describe it as generic across mental health conditions; OHEO classes it as condition-specific for mental health, like the ReQoL-UI.</obo:IAO_0000116>
