        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">OBSOLETE. An outcome reference case requirement that EQ-5D-5L responses are converted to utilities by mapping to the EQ-5D-3L value set with the NICE Decision Support Unit mapping function.</obo:IAO_0000115>
