    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/oheo/OHEO_0000361">
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">OBSOLETE. An outcome reference case requirement that costs and health effects are discounted at the French public rate of 2.5% a year for horizons under 30 years, falling gradually to a floor of 1.5% beyond that.</obo:IAO_0000115>
