    <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/oheo">
        <priorVersion xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#" rdf:resource="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontology/oheo/0.2.0/oheo.owl"/>
        <comment xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">Version 0.3.0 moves every OHEO address from https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontology/oheo to https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/oheo, so the ontology identifier, its version identifier and its terms match the ontology page on the site. Every class, property, definition and axiom is the same as in 0.2.0, and the imports now point to the family releases made at the same time (HEO 2.0.0, RHEO 0.4.0, OHEO 0.3.0, HETO 0.3.0, HEAO 0.2.0, HEMO 0.2.0, HELO 0.2.0, HEIRO 0.2.0). The old /ontology/ addresses are retired and are not redirected.</comment>
    </rdf:Description>
